# DO nancy-drew.configure-ini --into=<the game's folder>
#
# What every .ini file in a Nancy Drew game's folder has changed once it's
# installed (ini.yaml: LCD mode, saves in Documents). Every edition's stage
# that installs the game ends with it, given the bundle's install folder.
FUNCTION configure-ini
  INPUT into
  NANCY-DREW.CONFIGURE-INI ${input.into}
END
